<title>GERMANY: Degussa says 95/96 profit slightly up.</title>
<headline>Degussa says 95/96 profit slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and metals group Degussa AG said on Tuesday its 1995/1996 pre-tax profit was slightly above the previous year's record level.</p>
<p>Degussa's 1995/96 year ended on September 30. In 1994/1995, pre-tax profit jumped to 404 million marks ($265.3 million) from 280 million.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.522 German Marks)</p>
